-           - For `k` from 0 to 8: `edge = Utilities.TInternalEdges[v.in_cell][k]`, `e += v.eis[edge]` [S1, unofficial].
-           - `euler += v.euler`, `qef.add(v.qef)`, `normal = normal.add(v.normal)`, `count++` [S1, unofficial].
-       - If `count == 0`, continue to next `i` [S1, unofficial].
-       - Set `face_prop2 = true` [S1, unofficial].
-       - For `f` from 0 to 5:
-         - If `face_prop2`:
-           - `intersections = 0` [S1, unofficial].
-           - For `ei` from 0 to 3: `intersections += edges[Utilities.TFaces[f][ei]]` [S1, unofficial].
-           - If `intersections != 0` and `intersections != 2`, set `face_prop2 = false` [S1, unofficial].
